{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1301844-a-couple-lunar-charms-that-are-concerning","id":1301844,"title":"A couple Lunar Charms that are concerning","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-02T03:29:39-07:00","id":1301844,"title":"A couple Lunar Charms that are concerning","content":"So there are two lunar charms I'm a bit...worried about? I haven't dug a ton but these stuck out.<br /> Invincible Beast Warrior Empowerment gives....Size and Might and Drill and Lunar Charisma Commands into auto successes?<br /> Are these capped at Charm limits? Because otherwise, that reads pretty easily as over 10 auto successes? 15 with excellency and no stunt? At size 1?<br /> <br /> And secondly, does...does Secret Sense intuition just make ambush forever impossible? Like, as written you auto roll whenever someone stealths into short range--and failing just reduces an ambush to suprise?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-02T04:25:41-07:00","id":1301852,"title":"","content":"Hmmm... no I don't think they are capped by Charm limit, because there's no limit to cap them.<br /> Mortal battle groups don't have a cap for dice or successes added by charms.<br /> I suppose the one part might be when you roll to rally a unit and get bonus successes instead of dice from their Drill? That's arguable. But they definitely are not capped on their attack rolls.<br /> <br /> I will point out that it's very, very, very expensive, and right at the very top of the tree.<br /> I mean, don't get me wrong, it's a very strong charm. But it needs Essence 4, 7 prerequisite charms, and costs 15m, 1wp, and you have to spend 2i every turn (and you're not recovering initiative while making command rolls).<br /> <br /> Secret Sense... yeah, I think it does make Ambushes impossible. Not 100% sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-02T04:29:44-07:00","id":1301855,"title":"","content":"Secret Sense only causes trouble for short-range ambushes, a stealth-archer sniper is still good to go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25050-fodor","name":"FODOR","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-02T04:49:13-07:00","id":1301861,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1301844-a-couple-lunar-charms-that-are-concerning?p=1301852#post1301852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm... no I don't think they are capped by Charm limit, because there's no limit to cap them.<br /> Mortal battle groups don't have a cap for dice or successes added by charms.<br /> I suppose the one part might be when you roll to rally a unit and get bonus successes instead of dice from their Drill? That's arguable. But they definitely are not capped on their attack rolls.<br /> <br /> I will point out that it's very, very, very expensive, and right at the very top of the tree.<br /> I mean, don't get me wrong, it's a very strong charm. But it needs Essence 4, 7 prerequisite charms, and costs 15m, 1wp, and you have to spend 2i every turn (and you're not recovering initiative while making command rolls).</div> </div> </div> </div>While this is true, it seems like 15 auto successes on an attack roll (and therefore as dice to the damage die) for a size 1 battle group is, uh, a tad much? Especailly as the battle group attacks an entire range band. Like, if your SOLAR SWORD PRINCESS, Melee 5 Dex 5, max excellency (parry 12, burn a wp for 13), your auto hit with some to spare. 15m, 1wp, and -2i a turn seem relatively cheap if a lunar elder can end a fight with 5-10 opponents in 2 turns<br /> (And if your a lunar elder bringing a Size 3-4 battle group, that's gonna be in the low twenties in auto successes).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-02T04:49:45-07:00","id":1301862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-